with the old version, where it was a choice between the adventure and
a menial job - after all, the Guidebook says that you decide that even
if the Amulet doesn't have any special powers you could sell the tales
of your adventure.  Even so, they would likely escape the dungeon as
soon as they'd found enough money to live on.

